  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Looking for a career-focused, dynamic college in the heart of Dublin? CCT College Dublin (the full form of CCT College being 'College of Computing Technology') is an excellent choice. Renowned for its strong industry links and innovative teaching, CCT offers a range of undergraduate and postgraduate programmes in high-demand fields such as Computing, Data Analytics, Cybersecurity, Business, and Information Technology.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>At CCT College Dublin, you’ll be part of a welcoming and inclusive community. You'll benefit from personalised attention due to the small class sizes. Plus, you’ll always be engaged in something, as the college has many student-run clubs and events throughout the year.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>While CCT does not offer on-campus accommodation, the college helps you find housing in Dublin. You can choose from a range of homestays, shared apartments, private rentals, or student dormitories close to the city centre.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>The Hume Library is the college’s information and learning hub in CCT’s Learning Resource Centre. It gives you access to extensive academic materials, digital databases, and quiet study areas. You also get a membership in the Technological University Dublin (TUD) library network.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>At CCT College Dublin, you'll work in modern labs designed for cloud computing, networking, data analytics, and programming.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
